1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,325
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:02:25,225 --> 00:02:27,685
-Hurry up.
-Easy! My leg!

3
00:02:32,025 --> 00:02:34,201
Chief, while I was following Meng Tinghui,

4
00:02:34,225 --> 00:02:35,965
I found this cripple following her too.

5
00:02:36,225 --> 00:02:37,601
He was the gatekeeper
at our gambling house.

6
00:02:37,625 --> 00:02:39,841
The last time Meng Tinghui went there,

7
00:02:39,865 --> 00:02:40,881
he was the one who spotted her.

8
00:02:40,905 --> 00:02:42,205
He told me

9
00:02:42,465 --> 00:02:44,285
he has a way to bring Meng Tinghui down.

10
00:02:45,545 --> 00:02:46,805
Who exactly are you?

11
00:02:47,385 --> 00:02:48,645
Chief.

12
00:02:49,265 --> 00:02:51,241
I am Meng Tinghui's enemy.

13
00:02:51,265 --> 00:02:53,685
I knew that girl ten years ago.

14
00:02:53,945 --> 00:02:56,601
She is the one who ruined my leg.

15
00:02:56,625 --> 00:02:58,201
Because of Meng Tinghui,

16
00:02:58,225 --> 00:03:00,921
I became a cripple despised by everyone.

17
00:03:00,945 --> 00:03:02,241
I had to change my name

18
00:03:02,265 --> 00:03:04,001
and flee my homeland.

19
00:03:04,025 --> 00:03:06,081
For ten years, I have not
slept a peaceful night.

20
00:03:06,105 --> 00:03:09,245
I long to devour her flesh
and drink her blood, Chief.

21
00:03:09,705 --> 00:03:11,001
My hatred for that wretch

22
00:03:11,025 --> 00:03:12,201
is no less than yours.

23
00:03:12,225 --> 00:03:14,401
I want to join the Tiger Roar Gang.

24
00:03:14,425 --> 00:03:15,925
Become my protector,

25
00:03:16,425 --> 00:03:18,085
and I will help you eliminate her.

26
00:03:20,745 --> 00:03:22,161
I investigated him.

27
00:03:22,185 --> 00:03:24,525
Ten years ago, he was indeed in Shazhou,

28
00:03:24,985 --> 00:03:26,645
trafficking children.

29
00:03:41,065 --> 00:03:43,041
A man who even dared sell children

30
00:03:43,065 --> 00:03:44,841
thinks he can bargain with me?

31
00:03:44,865 --> 00:03:46,681
Spare me, Chief!

32
00:03:46,705 --> 00:03:49,401
I truly lost my senses back then.

33
00:03:49,425 --> 00:03:50,721
I deserve to die.

34
00:03:50,745 --> 00:03:52,085
But Chief,

35
00:03:53,105 --> 00:03:55,001
Meng Tinghui's dearest sister

36
00:03:55,025 --> 00:03:57,561
died by my hand.

37
00:03:57,585 --> 00:03:59,965
I know what she fears and hates.

38
00:04:00,225 --> 00:04:01,481
With me,

39
00:04:01,505 --> 00:04:04,805
you can bring her down. Please give me a chance.

40
00:04:05,905 --> 00:04:07,045
All right.

41
00:04:08,025 --> 00:04:10,485
I will let you try.

42
00:04:11,745 --> 00:04:14,361
Remember, you are merely a cripple

43
00:04:14,385 --> 00:04:16,481
driven mad by his thirst for revenge.

44
00:04:16,505 --> 00:04:18,325
You have absolutely nothing

45
00:04:18,705 --> 00:04:22,045
-to do with the Tiger Roar Gang.
-Thank you, Chief.

46
00:04:36,185 --> 00:04:37,601
Wait.

47
00:04:37,625 --> 00:04:39,561
Do not add salt until
the meat turns golden.

48
00:04:39,585 --> 00:04:41,005
Miss Yan,

49
00:04:41,185 --> 00:04:44,041
this is the authentic Beijian method.

50
00:04:44,065 --> 00:04:45,001
You...

51
00:04:45,025 --> 00:04:47,085
Would you know better
than someone from Shazhou?

52
00:04:47,385 --> 00:04:48,925
Mengmeng, you be the judge.

53
00:04:52,105 --> 00:04:53,001
Mengmeng.

54
00:04:53,025 --> 00:04:54,805
Why are you so distracted?

55
00:04:55,945 --> 00:04:57,085
Nothing.

56
00:04:57,505 --> 00:04:58,961
I may have been overworked lately

57
00:04:58,985 --> 00:05:00,361
and unable to settle my mind.

58
00:05:00,385 --> 00:05:02,281
Then relax properly today.

59
00:05:02,305 --> 00:05:04,681
Young Lord Shen has spared no expense

60
00:05:04,705 --> 00:05:06,321
on this grand banquet
to celebrate your success.

61
00:05:06,345 --> 00:05:08,285
He chose to hold the feast here.

62
00:05:08,585 --> 00:05:10,325
I suspect the wine is not his true concern.

63
00:05:11,105 --> 00:05:12,681
There are so many
restaurants on Changle Street,

64
00:05:12,705 --> 00:05:14,241
yet he chose your Bofeng House.

65
00:05:14,265 --> 00:05:16,765
His intentions are hardly insignificant.

66
00:05:17,865 --> 00:05:19,601
That is because I have the finest view

67
00:05:19,625 --> 00:05:21,281
and the best roasted meat.

68
00:05:21,305 --> 00:05:22,481
As for Shen Zhishu,

69
00:05:22,505 --> 00:05:23,601
apart from that face,

70
00:05:23,625 --> 00:05:24,801
what else does he have to offer?

71
00:05:24,825 --> 00:05:26,801
He spends all day flirting with women.

72
00:05:26,825 --> 00:05:28,325
He is clearly unreliable.

73
00:05:28,785 --> 00:05:30,001
Last time...

74
00:05:30,025 --> 00:05:32,401
Last time, I even saw him at Huiyin House.

75
00:05:32,425 --> 00:05:33,921
You even remember which
butterfly he was chasing

76
00:05:33,945 --> 00:05:34,841
that time so clearly.

77
00:05:34,865 --> 00:05:36,245
You...

78
00:05:36,985 --> 00:05:38,441
I merely felt

79
00:05:38,465 --> 00:05:39,921
sorry for the ladies of the capital.

80
00:05:39,945 --> 00:05:40,841
Shopkeeper Yan,

81
00:05:40,865 --> 00:05:42,761
you must answer for speaking
behind someone's back.

82
00:05:42,785 --> 00:05:43,801
You clearly just said

83
00:05:43,825 --> 00:05:45,001
that my face was worth looking at.

84
00:05:45,025 --> 00:05:46,601
Young Lord Shen is here.

85
00:05:46,625 --> 00:05:48,001
Greetings, Your Majesty.

86
00:05:48,025 --> 00:05:49,321
Your Majesty!

87
00:05:49,345 --> 00:05:51,681
No need for ceremony.
I brought some fine wine today

88
00:05:51,705 --> 00:05:53,401
to celebrate with everyone.

89
00:05:53,425 --> 00:05:54,645
Rise.

90
00:05:57,025 --> 00:05:59,001
I do not know what is wrong with my legs.

91
00:05:59,025 --> 00:06:00,721
Whenever I see His Majesty,
they stop obeying me

92
00:06:00,745 --> 00:06:01,921
and want to kneel and
kowtow again and again.

93
00:06:01,945 --> 00:06:04,121
Shen Zhishu, why did you not tell me
His Majesty was coming?

94
00:06:04,145 --> 00:06:06,121
Although I invited everyone today,

95
00:06:06,145 --> 00:06:07,441
I did so at His Majesty's request

96
00:06:07,465 --> 00:06:08,641
to celebrate Official Meng's success.

97
00:06:08,665 --> 00:06:11,561
The Left Chancellor
has recently been sending

98
00:06:11,585 --> 00:06:13,281
many noblewomen into the palace
to press His Majesty to choose an empress.

99
00:06:13,305 --> 00:06:15,281
-His Majesty came out to escape the commotion.
-Enough.

100
00:06:15,305 --> 00:06:16,645
Let us eat.

101
00:06:17,505 --> 00:06:18,521
The lamb is ready.

102
00:06:18,545 --> 00:06:20,201
There are also dishes from my hometown.

103
00:06:20,225 --> 00:06:21,121
Please try them.

104
00:06:21,145 --> 00:06:22,441
Anything you cooked

105
00:06:22,465 --> 00:06:23,765
His Majesty would not dare taste
anything you cooked.

106
00:06:25,985 --> 00:06:28,125
Then perhaps we should taste it
for His Majesty first.

107
00:06:35,145 --> 00:06:36,725
Fresh and delicious.

108
00:06:37,305 --> 00:06:38,681
It is good.

109
00:06:38,705 --> 00:06:41,125
My lord has excellent taste. I like it too.

110
00:06:52,865 --> 00:06:54,321
What is this?

111
00:06:54,345 --> 00:06:55,241
How dare you, Yin Qing!

112
00:06:55,265 --> 00:06:56,401
You tried to poison His Majesty!

113
00:06:56,425 --> 00:06:57,601
No...

114
00:06:57,625 --> 00:06:58,881
This is fish mint.

115
00:06:58,905 --> 00:06:59,961
It is edible.

116
00:06:59,985 --> 00:07:02,281
Look, my lord is enjoying it.

117
00:07:02,305 --> 00:07:03,401
Perhaps His Majesty's tastes

118
00:07:03,425 --> 00:07:05,685
and my lord's tastes differ...

119
00:07:06,145 --> 00:07:07,365
greatly.

120
00:07:08,745 --> 00:07:10,561
Huang Bo, bring the wine.

121
00:07:10,585 --> 00:07:12,161
Wait.

122
00:07:12,185 --> 00:07:14,521
The weather has been turning colder,

123
00:07:14,545 --> 00:07:16,161
so I brewed some fruit wine

124
00:07:16,185 --> 00:07:17,641
for everyone to taste.

125
00:07:17,665 --> 00:07:19,165
Wonderful!

126
00:07:38,505 --> 00:07:39,645
My turn.

127
00:07:42,425 --> 00:07:43,681
This fruit wine

128
00:07:43,705 --> 00:07:45,521
nourishes the complexion

129
00:07:45,545 --> 00:07:48,085
and makes one glow.

130
00:07:50,065 --> 00:07:51,285
However...

131
00:07:51,665 --> 00:07:54,725
for Official Meng and Miss Yan,

132
00:07:54,945 --> 00:07:56,601
its effects will be rather ordinary.

133
00:07:56,625 --> 00:07:57,965
-Why?
-Why?

134
00:07:58,225 --> 00:07:59,641
Because you two

135
00:07:59,665 --> 00:08:01,685
are naturally beautiful.

136
00:08:16,145 --> 00:08:17,685
Yin Qing,

137
00:08:17,945 --> 00:08:20,361
you have been working nonstop.

138
00:08:20,385 --> 00:08:21,441
Sit down and rest.

139
00:08:21,465 --> 00:08:22,605
Certainly.

140
00:08:23,545 --> 00:08:25,601
The lamb has gone a little cold.

141
00:08:25,625 --> 00:08:27,605
-It needs reheating.
-I will do it.

142
00:08:35,305 --> 00:08:37,601
The fruit wine is cold too. Warm it up.

143
00:08:37,625 --> 00:08:40,205
Of course. Here I go again.

144
00:08:42,905 --> 00:08:45,125
Yin Qing, I will help you.

145
00:08:48,785 --> 00:08:50,841
How could your cooking compare with his?

146
00:08:50,865 --> 00:08:52,165
Sit.

147
00:09:06,705 --> 00:09:08,361
If Your Majesty has any
grievance against me,

148
00:09:08,385 --> 00:09:09,965
please say it directly.

149
00:09:10,865 --> 00:09:12,601
When have I ever had
a grievance against you?

150
00:09:12,625 --> 00:09:14,561
Then why is Your Majesty making things
difficult for my colleague?

151
00:09:14,585 --> 00:09:16,085
You call that making things difficult?

152
00:09:18,465 --> 00:09:19,961
It seems Director Meng

153
00:09:19,985 --> 00:09:22,125
cares far more about
her colleagues than about me.

154
00:09:29,385 --> 00:09:30,525
Your Majesty.

155
00:09:30,905 --> 00:09:32,921
Changle Street was crowded
with people and carriages.

156
00:09:32,945 --> 00:09:34,521
I am sorry to have
kept Your Majesty waiting.

157
00:09:34,545 --> 00:09:36,561
I also spent a little time dressing,

158
00:09:36,585 --> 00:09:37,481
which delayed me.

159
00:09:37,505 --> 00:09:39,281
Sit down and try
the specialties of Shazhou.

160
00:09:39,305 --> 00:09:40,605
Come, sit over here.

161
00:09:42,025 --> 00:09:43,401
I know you do not eat ginger.

162
00:09:43,425 --> 00:09:45,201
This has neither scallions nor garlic.

163
00:09:45,225 --> 00:09:46,401
I guarantee you will like it.

164
00:09:46,425 --> 00:09:47,641
Thank you, Yin Qing.

165
00:09:47,665 --> 00:09:49,605
You are always the
kindest and most attentive.

166
00:09:51,185 --> 00:09:52,081
So there is someone in this world

167
00:09:52,105 --> 00:09:53,961
who understands
Zhili's tastes better than you.

168
00:09:53,985 --> 00:09:55,081
Still,

169
00:09:55,105 --> 00:09:57,041
it is good for Zhili to spend
more time with Yin Qing.

170
00:09:57,065 --> 00:09:58,041
After all, she is an unmarried young woman.

171
00:09:58,065 --> 00:10:00,165
It is better than being
too close to her teacher.

172
00:10:02,305 --> 00:10:04,161
Sister Shen, Captain Di,

173
00:10:04,185 --> 00:10:06,001
you are late. You must drink
three cups as punishment.

174
00:10:06,025 --> 00:10:07,201
Very well.

175
00:10:07,225 --> 00:10:08,281
I will drink

176
00:10:08,305 --> 00:10:09,561
Sister Zhili's share for her.

177
00:10:09,585 --> 00:10:10,805
There is no need...

178
00:10:11,865 --> 00:10:13,285
Captain Di, sit down.

179
00:10:13,865 --> 00:10:14,761
This

180
00:10:14,785 --> 00:10:16,445
is fruit wine I brewed myself.

181
00:10:16,865 --> 00:10:17,921
It is good for the complexion.

182
00:10:17,945 --> 00:10:19,885
Do you know Sister Zhili
cannot hold her liquor?

183
00:10:26,905 --> 00:10:28,921
Today is a celebration.
We should enjoy ourselves.

184
00:10:28,945 --> 00:10:30,081
Tomorrow,

185
00:10:30,105 --> 00:10:32,085
we will surely find a
clue to the Tiger Roar Gang.

186
00:10:34,545 --> 00:10:35,965
Then let us wish

187
00:10:36,665 --> 00:10:37,845
for everything to go smoothly tomorrow.

188
00:10:38,705 --> 00:10:41,645
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

189
00:10:59,585 --> 00:11:01,841
Official Meng stands high above everyone

190
00:11:01,865 --> 00:11:03,881
and can naturally speak
grandly of conscience.

191
00:11:03,905 --> 00:11:05,525
But for people like us,

192
00:11:06,665 --> 00:11:07,805
kindness...

193
00:11:08,545 --> 00:11:10,685
only makes us die sooner.

194
00:11:15,305 --> 00:11:17,405
You use having no choice as an excuse

195
00:11:18,305 --> 00:11:20,521
to help tyrants commit
evil with a clear conscience?

196
00:11:20,545 --> 00:11:22,205
As a fellow woman,

197
00:11:23,065 --> 00:11:24,281
you watched those girls

198
00:11:24,305 --> 00:11:25,441
be pushed into a living hell.

199
00:11:25,465 --> 00:11:27,401
You heard them cry and beg for help,

200
00:11:27,425 --> 00:11:29,521
yet you smiled as you handed
their tormentors the whip.

201
00:11:29,545 --> 00:11:31,845
A-Yue was only eighteen.

202
00:11:32,745 --> 00:11:34,281
She was tortured to death.

203
00:11:34,305 --> 00:11:36,445
Have you never had nightmares at night?

204
00:11:40,385 --> 00:11:41,525
Nightmares?

205
00:11:48,985 --> 00:11:50,645
Official Meng,

206
00:11:51,425 --> 00:11:52,801
this is what

207
00:11:52,825 --> 00:11:55,045
the conscience you speak of brought me.

208
00:11:55,345 --> 00:11:57,285
I was only fourteen

209
00:11:57,545 --> 00:11:58,921
when I was sold there.

210
00:11:58,945 --> 00:12:01,685
They tortured me like livestock.

211
00:12:03,585 --> 00:12:05,485
I was locked in the gambling house dungeon.

212
00:12:05,745 --> 00:12:07,961
They chained me to an iron post

213
00:12:07,985 --> 00:12:08,881
for an entire month,

214
00:12:08,905 --> 00:12:10,361
drugged me,

215
00:12:10,385 --> 00:12:12,765
and then hung me naked

216
00:12:12,945 --> 00:12:14,725
from the gambling house's second floor.

217
00:12:14,985 --> 00:12:16,881
They let every gambler wager

218
00:12:16,905 --> 00:12:18,885
on how many days it would take me to beg.

219
00:12:20,265 --> 00:12:22,205
Do you think I had a choice?

220
00:12:24,905 --> 00:12:26,285
Either submit

221
00:12:27,545 --> 00:12:28,685
or die.

222
00:12:29,625 --> 00:12:31,285
I did not want to die.

223
00:12:32,305 --> 00:12:33,885
I wanted to live.

224
00:12:35,985 --> 00:12:37,401
Even if I had to live like a ghost,

225
00:12:37,425 --> 00:12:38,965
I still wanted to live.

226
00:12:40,665 --> 00:12:42,005
Was I wrong?

227
00:12:42,345 --> 00:12:43,321
Official Meng,

228
00:12:43,345 --> 00:12:46,285
Not everyone is entitled

229
00:12:47,145 --> 00:12:49,405
to live with clean hands like you.

230
00:13:10,985 --> 00:13:12,605
Tell me about the dealings

231
00:13:13,025 --> 00:13:15,005
between Xingrong Gambling House
and the Tiger Roar Gang.

232
00:13:15,305 --> 00:13:16,561
I stake my life on it:

233
00:13:16,585 --> 00:13:18,725
I will avenge this blood debt for you.

234
00:13:19,945 --> 00:13:21,085
Fumeng,

235
00:13:21,305 --> 00:13:22,725
you still hate them, do you not?

236
00:13:23,065 --> 00:13:24,681
You hate the people who made you this way.

237
00:13:24,705 --> 00:13:27,401
But if you continue
helping them commit evil,

238
00:13:27,425 --> 00:13:30,001
you are stabbing the girl you once were.

239
00:13:30,025 --> 00:13:31,801
If Hao Wenming truly
regarded you as one of his own,

240
00:13:31,825 --> 00:13:33,241
why are you

241
00:13:33,265 --> 00:13:34,601
still confined to the gambling house?

242
00:13:34,625 --> 00:13:35,921
Fumeng,

243
00:13:35,945 --> 00:13:38,085
you know their methods better than anyone.

244
00:13:38,745 --> 00:13:39,885
Speak.

245
00:13:40,185 --> 00:13:41,725
Have you ever considered

246
00:13:41,985 --> 00:13:43,285
what they fear?

247
00:13:43,705 --> 00:13:45,201
What they fear most

248
00:13:45,225 --> 00:13:46,361
is people like you

249
00:13:46,385 --> 00:13:48,045
standing up to testify against them.

250
00:13:50,985 --> 00:13:52,765
But what you want to know,

251
00:13:54,065 --> 00:13:55,801
I truly know nothing about.

252
00:13:55,825 --> 00:13:57,761
Hao Wenming

253
00:13:57,785 --> 00:13:58,841
never allowed those under him

254
00:13:58,865 --> 00:14:00,681
to ask about the Tiger Roar Gang.

255
00:14:00,705 --> 00:14:03,201
We only handled odd
jobs at the gambling house

256
00:14:03,225 --> 00:14:04,881
and sent the girls into the private rooms.

257
00:14:04,905 --> 00:14:07,241
So I have never met
anyone from the Tiger Roar Gang.

258
00:14:07,265 --> 00:14:09,325
You became Hao Wenming's most trusted aide,

259
00:14:09,865 --> 00:14:10,761
and you still pretend to know nothing?

260
00:14:10,785 --> 00:14:12,321
Hao Wenming

261
00:14:12,345 --> 00:14:13,765
was extremely cautious.

262
00:14:14,225 --> 00:14:15,921
Besides, with matters at this point,

263
00:14:15,945 --> 00:14:17,645
what reason would I have to hide anything?

264
00:14:18,705 --> 00:14:20,841
I will die either way.

265
00:14:20,865 --> 00:14:22,241
Let me serve those girls

266
00:14:22,265 --> 00:14:23,805
as an ox or horse in the afterlife.

267
00:14:24,145 --> 00:14:26,045
I will kneel before them

268
00:14:26,905 --> 00:14:28,365
and beg forgiveness.

269
00:14:31,105 --> 00:14:32,245
My lord.

270
00:14:32,985 --> 00:14:35,605
Our only breakthrough now is Hao Wenming.

271
00:14:45,465 --> 00:14:47,525
Brother Hao, wake up.

272
00:14:48,065 --> 00:14:50,321
Fumeng has confessed everything

273
00:14:50,345 --> 00:14:52,205
about Xingrong Gambling House
and the Tiger Roar Gang.

274
00:14:52,465 --> 00:14:54,405
If you can tell us something new,

275
00:14:54,745 --> 00:14:56,085
you may be allowed to live.

276
00:14:56,825 --> 00:14:58,485
She does not know a damn thing.

277
00:15:00,185 --> 00:15:01,725
You two little brats

278
00:15:02,345 --> 00:15:03,485
are trying to trick me.

279
00:15:14,465 --> 00:15:16,765
Under severe punishment, cowards emerge.

280
00:15:17,225 --> 00:15:19,165
Under great rewards, brave men emerge.

281
00:15:19,705 --> 00:15:22,045
Would you care to gamble with your life?

282
00:15:22,345 --> 00:15:24,601
Let us see whether, if you keep silent,

283
00:15:24,625 --> 00:15:26,041
the Tiger Roar Gang comes to rescue you

284
00:15:26,065 --> 00:15:27,325
or comes to kill you.

285
00:15:28,345 --> 00:15:30,601
Tell us everything you
know about Ling Yunfei

286
00:15:30,625 --> 00:15:33,201
and every court official colluding
with the Tiger Roar Gang.

287
00:15:33,225 --> 00:15:34,761
Do not omit a single word.

288
00:15:34,785 --> 00:15:36,281
Hao Wenming,

289
00:15:36,305 --> 00:15:38,085
this is your only chance to live.

290
00:15:40,185 --> 00:15:41,201
My lord,

291
00:15:41,225 --> 00:15:42,925
why waste words on him?

292
00:15:43,545 --> 00:15:45,565
Until he tastes the branding iron,

293
00:15:46,105 --> 00:15:48,205
he will keep pretending to be tough.

294
00:16:01,345 --> 00:16:03,841
I...

295
00:16:03,865 --> 00:16:05,441
I will confess...

296
00:16:05,465 --> 00:16:06,681
I will.

297
00:16:06,705 --> 00:16:07,641
I will tell you everything.

298
00:16:07,665 --> 00:16:09,441
I will write down

299
00:16:09,465 --> 00:16:10,765
everything I know.

300
00:16:19,385 --> 00:16:20,645
Guards!

301
00:16:30,385 --> 00:16:31,721
Call a physician.

302
00:16:31,745 --> 00:16:32,885
Yes.

303
00:16:35,585 --> 00:16:38,005
You would rather die than confess.

304
00:16:38,385 --> 00:16:39,645
I fear death,

305
00:16:41,025 --> 00:16:43,405
but I fear Ling Yunfei even more.

306
00:16:45,425 --> 00:16:46,845
A traitor's

307
00:16:49,025 --> 00:16:50,605
entire family is buried with him.

308
00:16:51,465 --> 00:16:53,845
That is the Tiger Roar Gang's rule.

309
00:16:54,105 --> 00:16:56,485
The day I boarded this ship,

310
00:16:58,345 --> 00:17:00,525
I wrote my will

311
00:17:02,025 --> 00:17:03,241
for my wife and children.

312
00:17:03,265 --> 00:17:05,525
You only need to stand up and testify,

313
00:17:06,425 --> 00:17:08,645
and I can destroy the Tiger Roar Gang.

314
00:17:09,025 --> 00:17:10,165
Official Meng.

315
00:17:13,545 --> 00:17:14,685
You...

316
00:17:15,185 --> 00:17:16,525
are good people.

317
00:17:16,865 --> 00:17:18,121
What happened to me today

318
00:17:18,145 --> 00:17:20,961
is entirely what I deserve.

319
00:17:20,985 --> 00:17:22,645
You cannot defeat him.

320
00:17:24,505 --> 00:17:25,725
Besides...

321
00:17:26,505 --> 00:17:28,045
The one you are fighting

322
00:17:29,385 --> 00:17:30,605
has never

323
00:17:31,345 --> 00:17:32,881
been him alone.

324
00:17:32,905 --> 00:17:34,165
Who else is there?

325
00:17:35,145 --> 00:17:36,285
Tell me.

326
00:17:39,865 --> 00:17:41,325
Official Meng,

327
00:17:41,745 --> 00:17:44,125
I beg you...

328
00:17:46,105 --> 00:17:47,685
For my family's sake,

329
00:17:48,625 --> 00:17:49,925
just say

330
00:17:50,905 --> 00:17:52,685
that I confessed nothing.

331
00:17:55,785 --> 00:17:56,681
Where is the physician?

332
00:17:56,705 --> 00:17:57,845
Physician!

333
00:17:58,825 --> 00:17:59,965
Hao Wenming!

334
00:18:38,745 --> 00:18:40,321
You have worked hard
on the case these past few days

335
00:18:40,345 --> 00:18:41,841
and have hardly eaten a proper meal.

336
00:18:41,865 --> 00:18:43,721
Set official business aside tonight

337
00:18:43,745 --> 00:18:44,681
and try Bofeng House's

338
00:18:44,705 --> 00:18:46,161
new signature dishes.

339
00:18:46,185 --> 00:18:47,445
All right.

340
00:18:49,465 --> 00:18:51,081
There are many guests tonight.

341
00:18:51,105 --> 00:18:52,441
I will attend to the front hall.

342
00:18:52,465 --> 00:18:54,165
You must all eat properly.

343
00:18:55,025 --> 00:18:56,161
All right.

344
00:18:56,185 --> 00:18:57,765
Especially you.

345
00:19:06,305 --> 00:19:07,521
I have no appetite.

346
00:19:07,545 --> 00:19:09,721
Our bluff failed.

347
00:19:09,745 --> 00:19:11,161
Fumeng said

348
00:19:11,185 --> 00:19:12,721
the only person in contact
with the Tiger Roar Gang

349
00:19:12,745 --> 00:19:14,325
was Hao Wenming.

350
00:19:14,585 --> 00:19:15,961
Now Hao Wenming is dead,

351
00:19:15,985 --> 00:19:17,161
and every lead is gone.

352
00:19:17,185 --> 00:19:18,961
Ling Yunfei's whereabouts are unknown.

353
00:19:18,985 --> 00:19:20,605
And the force behind him...

354
00:19:21,105 --> 00:19:22,965
who exactly are they?

355
00:19:24,865 --> 00:19:26,525
I previously suspected

356
00:19:26,785 --> 00:19:28,801
that the cross Wan Kai left behind

357
00:19:28,825 --> 00:19:30,605
may instead concern someone's identity.

358
00:19:30,945 --> 00:19:33,361
Before dying, Hao Wenming
also deliberately said

359
00:19:33,385 --> 00:19:35,201
that I was not fighting Ling Yunfei alone.

360
00:19:35,225 --> 00:19:37,805
Lü Er also mentioned the person behind him
before he died.

361
00:19:38,465 --> 00:19:39,965
Could all three clues

362
00:19:40,705 --> 00:19:42,565
point to the same person?

363
00:19:44,905 --> 00:19:46,045
It is possible.

364
00:19:46,545 --> 00:19:48,081
Could this cross

365
00:19:48,105 --> 00:19:50,165
be part of a written character?

366
00:19:50,785 --> 00:19:51,681
"Xiang."

367
00:19:51,705 --> 00:19:52,841
Could it

368
00:19:52,865 --> 00:19:54,405
refer to a Chancellor?

369
00:19:54,745 --> 00:19:56,601
Someone with overwhelming power...

370
00:19:56,625 --> 00:19:58,005
That could very well
be the Left Chancellor.

371
00:19:58,785 --> 00:20:00,761
Add a box beneath the
cross and it forms "Gu."

372
00:20:00,785 --> 00:20:02,001
It could also point
to the Right Chancellor.

373
00:20:02,025 --> 00:20:03,365
Absolutely impossible.

374
00:20:03,745 --> 00:20:05,201
I know my teacher's character well.

375
00:20:05,225 --> 00:20:06,681
He is not the kind of treacherous schemer

376
00:20:06,705 --> 00:20:07,841
who would collude with Ling Yunfei.

377
00:20:07,865 --> 00:20:09,761
I will stake my reputation on him.

378
00:20:09,785 --> 00:20:11,721
I was only making a guess.

379
00:20:11,745 --> 00:20:12,641
Why take it so seriously?

380
00:20:12,665 --> 00:20:14,281
That was hardly a guess.

381
00:20:14,305 --> 00:20:15,361
It was baseless nonsense.

382
00:20:15,385 --> 00:20:17,165
Zhili also has a point.

383
00:20:18,585 --> 00:20:20,285
Without conclusive evidence,

384
00:20:20,825 --> 00:20:23,165
every suspicion is merely speculation.

385
00:20:25,465 --> 00:20:26,881
To uncover the truth,

386
00:20:26,905 --> 00:20:28,201
we must find Ling Yunfei.

387
00:20:28,225 --> 00:20:29,681
Other shops on Changle Street

388
00:20:29,705 --> 00:20:31,721
may also be connected
to the Tiger Roar Gang.

389
00:20:31,745 --> 00:20:33,241
We cannot let go

390
00:20:33,265 --> 00:20:34,161
of even the slightest possibility.

391
00:20:34,185 --> 00:20:35,441
-Yes.
-Yes.

392
00:20:35,465 --> 00:20:36,605
Then we...

393
00:20:36,945 --> 00:20:38,081
should eat properly.

394
00:20:38,105 --> 00:20:39,725
Especially you.

395
00:20:52,505 --> 00:20:53,961
-Shopkeeper Yan.
-Shopkeeper Yan.

396
00:20:53,985 --> 00:20:55,761
Is Official Meng here today?

397
00:20:55,785 --> 00:20:58,045
Could we meet Official Meng?

398
00:20:58,665 --> 00:21:00,081
Meet Mengmeng?

399
00:21:00,105 --> 00:21:02,281
Yes. Official Meng destroyed

400
00:21:02,305 --> 00:21:04,121
the wicked Xingrong
Gambling House in one stroke

401
00:21:04,145 --> 00:21:05,801
and saved so many women.

402
00:21:05,825 --> 00:21:07,321
-She is truly a heroine among women.
-Shopkeeper Yan.

403
00:21:07,345 --> 00:21:08,601
You are here too.

404
00:21:08,625 --> 00:21:10,205
Come, let me through.

405
00:21:10,465 --> 00:21:12,521
Though Shopkeeper Yan and Official Meng
are not sisters by blood,

406
00:21:12,545 --> 00:21:14,361
they are closer than true sisters.

407
00:21:14,385 --> 00:21:15,401
To have such a friend

408
00:21:15,425 --> 00:21:16,961
-is truly enviable.
-Shopkeeper Yan.

409
00:21:16,985 --> 00:21:18,481
We came because of her reputation.

410
00:21:18,505 --> 00:21:19,481
Could you make an exception

411
00:21:19,505 --> 00:21:20,761
and let us meet Official Meng?

412
00:21:20,785 --> 00:21:21,961
Yes.

413
00:21:21,985 --> 00:21:23,241
Please let us meet her.

414
00:21:23,265 --> 00:21:24,921
Everyone, please be patient.

415
00:21:24,945 --> 00:21:27,321
Official Meng is busy today
and cannot be disturbed.

416
00:21:27,345 --> 00:21:28,481
However,

417
00:21:28,505 --> 00:21:30,841
I will personally cook for all of you today.

418
00:21:30,865 --> 00:21:31,921
-Great!
-Great!

419
00:21:31,945 --> 00:21:33,085
Please come inside.

420
00:21:33,585 --> 00:21:35,645
We finally get to taste Shopkeeper Yan's cooking.

421
00:22:41,105 --> 00:22:42,081
Mengmeng.

422
00:22:42,105 --> 00:22:43,245
What is wrong?

423
00:22:44,025 --> 00:22:45,165
Mengmeng.

424
00:22:45,745 --> 00:22:47,605
Mengmeng, sit down first.

425
00:22:48,025 --> 00:22:49,165
Slowly.

426
00:22:55,945 --> 00:22:57,961
Mengmeng, I made sugarcane
water especially for you.

427
00:22:57,985 --> 00:23:00,481
It replenishes the blood, relieves dryness,
and nourishes digestion.

428
00:23:00,505 --> 00:23:01,645
Drink some more.

429
00:23:09,665 --> 00:23:10,561
Mengmeng,

430
00:23:10,585 --> 00:23:11,921
Bofeng House was bustling today.

431
00:23:11,945 --> 00:23:12,881
So many people came,

432
00:23:12,905 --> 00:23:14,241
all hoping to see you.

433
00:23:14,265 --> 00:23:16,925
They all called you a hero of Great Ning.

434
00:23:21,265 --> 00:23:22,925
The more they praise me,

435
00:23:27,185 --> 00:23:28,965
the worse I feel.

436
00:23:30,705 --> 00:23:32,765
Every lead to the
Tiger Roar Gang is now gone.

437
00:23:33,425 --> 00:23:35,325
If we cannot capture Ling Yunfei,

438
00:23:36,265 --> 00:23:37,801
all that praise

439
00:23:37,825 --> 00:23:39,565
will eventually turn into condemnation.

440
00:23:41,065 --> 00:23:43,765
You cannot put so much
pressure on yourself.

441
00:23:51,905 --> 00:23:53,045
Fuzhi,

442
00:23:53,945 --> 00:23:55,201
I am no longer the orphan girl from Shazhou

443
00:23:55,225 --> 00:23:56,965
who had nothing.

444
00:23:58,505 --> 00:24:00,365
Now I wear an official robe

445
00:24:00,905 --> 00:24:02,845
and carry the people's hopes.

446
00:24:03,105 --> 00:24:05,001
I understand even more clearly where

447
00:24:05,025 --> 00:24:06,365
the Bureau's official lantern should shine.

448
00:24:07,865 --> 00:24:09,605
The Tiger Roar Gang must be eliminated

449
00:24:10,305 --> 00:24:12,321
so desperate people hidden in dark corners

450
00:24:12,345 --> 00:24:13,725
can have a little more hope.

451
00:24:14,425 --> 00:24:16,365
Of course I believe in you.

452
00:24:17,025 --> 00:24:19,161
But you must promise me:

453
00:24:19,185 --> 00:24:20,681
when you hold an umbrella over others,

454
00:24:20,705 --> 00:24:22,525
protect yourself first.

455
00:24:30,425 --> 00:24:32,001
-I must leave now.
-Where are you going?

456
00:24:32,025 --> 00:24:34,801
Back to the palace to report
our leads to His Majesty,

457
00:24:34,825 --> 00:24:36,845
before he suspects me
of withholding information again.

458
00:24:45,745 --> 00:24:46,965
Miss Meng.

459
00:24:50,865 --> 00:24:51,961
Miss Meng!

460
00:24:51,985 --> 00:24:54,441
I have come today with betrothal gifts

461
00:24:54,465 --> 00:24:56,125
to take you as my wife.

462
00:24:56,945 --> 00:24:58,085
Miss Meng.

463
00:24:58,905 --> 00:25:00,201
So you do not even know

464
00:25:00,225 --> 00:25:01,365
which one is Miss Meng?

465
00:25:05,625 --> 00:25:07,645
Then this lady must be Miss Meng.

466
00:25:08,665 --> 00:25:10,961
I never imagined you were
even more beautiful than the rumors.

467
00:25:10,985 --> 00:25:13,005
You are so lovely.
I am determined to marry you.

468
00:25:14,185 --> 00:25:15,685
Stop.

469
00:25:25,665 --> 00:25:26,841
You think you are worthy?

470
00:25:26,865 --> 00:25:28,405
Who are you?

471
00:25:29,225 --> 00:25:32,085
I never conceal my name or identity.

472
00:25:32,265 --> 00:25:34,521
Xu Ting, the current Left Chancellor,
is my father.

473
00:25:34,545 --> 00:25:36,241
I am his only son,

474
00:25:36,265 --> 00:25:38,045
Xu Runze.

475
00:25:40,625 --> 00:25:41,765
Miss Meng,

476
00:25:42,025 --> 00:25:43,041
trust me.

477
00:25:43,065 --> 00:25:44,641
If the two of us marry,

478
00:25:44,665 --> 00:25:45,841
we will be a match made in heaven:

479
00:25:45,865 --> 00:25:47,401
a talented man and a
beautiful woman. No, wait...

480
00:25:47,425 --> 00:25:48,681
a talented woman and a handsome man.

481
00:25:48,705 --> 00:25:49,925
Keep your distance.

482
00:25:50,345 --> 00:25:51,481
Young Master Xu,

483
00:25:51,505 --> 00:25:54,005
does your father know you are out here
embarrassing yourself?

484
00:25:54,625 --> 00:25:55,961
My father said

485
00:25:55,985 --> 00:25:57,365
that a true man

486
00:25:57,705 --> 00:26:00,285
must charge forward once
he sees what he wants.

487
00:26:01,185 --> 00:26:03,365
Besides, I already wrote
the marriage contract.

488
00:26:05,225 --> 00:26:07,001
Today, the handsome

489
00:26:07,025 --> 00:26:09,361
and charming Xu Runze

490
00:26:09,385 --> 00:26:10,761
wishes to marry the breathtaking

491
00:26:10,785 --> 00:26:13,445
and talented Meng Tinghui.

492
00:26:13,705 --> 00:26:15,005
In this life,

493
00:26:15,425 --> 00:26:16,565
she shall be his only one.

494
00:26:18,665 --> 00:26:19,921
Thank you all for your support.

495
00:26:19,945 --> 00:26:22,005
Every expense at Bofeng House today

496
00:26:22,545 --> 00:26:24,281
is on me.

497
00:26:24,305 --> 00:26:25,641
Eat and drink to your hearts' content.

498
00:26:25,665 --> 00:26:26,961
Wonderful!

499
00:26:26,985 --> 00:26:29,005
-Eat up. Everyone, sit.
-Yan Fuzhi!

500
00:26:29,425 --> 00:26:30,565
Young Master Xu,

501
00:26:30,905 --> 00:26:32,361
you and I have never met.

502
00:26:32,385 --> 00:26:33,441
How can there be any talk of marriage?

503
00:26:33,465 --> 00:26:35,321
Please leave Bofeng House at once.

504
00:26:35,345 --> 00:26:36,241
It seems

505
00:26:36,265 --> 00:26:38,041
Young Master Xu has gone foolish
from studying too much.

506
00:26:38,065 --> 00:26:39,121
No...

507
00:26:39,145 --> 00:26:40,441
My father said

508
00:26:40,465 --> 00:26:41,961
I am foolish because I studied too little.

509
00:26:41,985 --> 00:26:44,721
That is why I need a talented wife
to improve the family bloodline.

510
00:26:44,745 --> 00:26:46,161
Miss Meng, just consider it...

511
00:26:46,185 --> 00:26:47,481
for the sake of the
Xu family's future descendants.

512
00:26:47,505 --> 00:26:49,601
-Marry me.
-Young Master Xu.

513
00:26:49,625 --> 00:26:51,041
Please stop making jokes at my expense.

514
00:26:51,065 --> 00:26:53,161
Miss Meng, I sincerely wish to marry you.

515
00:26:53,185 --> 00:26:56,001
My family has power, influence, and wealth.

516
00:26:56,025 --> 00:26:58,041
You need not worry that
you are unworthy of me.

517
00:26:58,065 --> 00:26:58,961
When I, Xu Runze, take a wife,

518
00:26:58,985 --> 00:27:00,521
I do not care about her family background.

519
00:27:00,545 --> 00:27:02,885
She only needs to be clever
and well-read like you.

520
00:27:03,865 --> 00:27:04,761
Servants!

521
00:27:04,785 --> 00:27:06,965
Carry every betrothal
gift into Bofeng House.

522
00:27:07,505 --> 00:27:08,681
Put them down.

523
00:27:08,705 --> 00:27:09,601
Let us see who dares.

524
00:27:09,625 --> 00:27:11,085
-Who dares enter?
-Wait.

525
00:27:19,945 --> 00:27:21,121
Young Master Xu,

526
00:27:21,145 --> 00:27:23,005
you are humiliating Miss Meng.

527
00:27:23,745 --> 00:27:24,961
Miss Situ,

528
00:27:24,985 --> 00:27:26,281
what gives you the right to say that?

529
00:27:26,305 --> 00:27:27,721
Is Miss Meng the sort of woman

530
00:27:27,745 --> 00:27:29,641
who would be swayed
by lavish betrothal gifts?

531
00:27:29,665 --> 00:27:31,445
By making such a spectacle,

532
00:27:32,065 --> 00:27:34,205
what position have you placed her in?

533
00:27:35,905 --> 00:27:38,161
Miss Meng, let me explain.

534
00:27:38,185 --> 00:27:39,325
Young Master Xu,

535
00:27:39,865 --> 00:27:41,041
if you keep talking,

536
00:27:41,065 --> 00:27:42,241
you will only make matters worse.

537
00:27:42,265 --> 00:27:44,485
If you sincerely wish to marry Miss Meng,

538
00:27:44,785 --> 00:27:46,481
let us go to Huiyin House.

539
00:27:46,505 --> 00:27:47,401
I have a plan.

540
00:27:47,425 --> 00:27:49,405
Miss Situ, let us leave at once.

541
00:27:59,425 --> 00:28:00,521
Young Master Xu,

542
00:28:00,545 --> 00:28:01,845
what about your betrothal gifts?

543
00:28:02,345 --> 00:28:05,045
They say the Left Chancellor has a son
with a most unusual mind.

544
00:28:05,745 --> 00:28:07,845
Today, I finally witnessed it.

545
00:28:11,425 --> 00:28:13,201
-You...
-Chief Steward You.

546
00:28:13,225 --> 00:28:15,321
His Majesty is handling state affairs
and cannot be disturbed.

547
00:28:15,345 --> 00:28:16,241
Huang Bo,

548
00:28:16,265 --> 00:28:18,001
you brat, how can you be so unreasonable?

549
00:28:18,025 --> 00:28:18,921
It is precisely because I know

550
00:28:18,945 --> 00:28:20,641
His Majesty is busy with state affairs

551
00:28:20,665 --> 00:28:21,881
that I came especially to ease his worries.

552
00:28:21,905 --> 00:28:23,285
Stop blocking me.

553
00:28:25,065 --> 00:28:26,441
Chief Steward You,

554
00:28:26,465 --> 00:28:28,361
His Majesty ordered
that no one disturb him.

555
00:28:28,385 --> 00:28:29,601
Please do not make things difficult for me.

556
00:28:29,625 --> 00:28:30,521
What?

557
00:28:30,545 --> 00:28:31,961
Am I merely "no one"?

558
00:28:31,985 --> 00:28:33,521
Others come to trouble His Majesty.

559
00:28:33,545 --> 00:28:35,161
I came to make him happy.

560
00:28:35,185 --> 00:28:36,325
Let me in.

561
00:28:36,945 --> 00:28:38,765
What are you doing...?

562
00:28:39,545 --> 00:28:42,485
Your Majesty...

563
00:28:44,185 --> 00:28:45,081
Your Majesty,

564
00:28:45,105 --> 00:28:46,921
this old servant heard you have been

565
00:28:46,945 --> 00:28:48,565
overwhelmed with state affairs lately.

566
00:28:48,825 --> 00:28:51,321
I spent ten days and nights

567
00:28:51,345 --> 00:28:52,841
preparing a wonderful performance for you.

568
00:28:52,865 --> 00:28:54,485
-Please, Your Majesty...
-Let us go.

569
00:28:55,865 --> 00:28:57,961
Wonderful. Coming...

570
00:28:57,985 --> 00:29:00,125
Your Majesty, the dance begins.

571
00:29:28,865 --> 00:29:29,921
This is the surprise

572
00:29:29,945 --> 00:29:31,481
you spent ten days and nights preparing?

573
00:29:31,505 --> 00:29:33,045
Your Majesty,

574
00:29:33,305 --> 00:29:34,605
are you surprised?

575
00:29:34,905 --> 00:29:36,885
Are you delighted? Was it unexpected?

576
00:29:37,305 --> 00:29:38,201
These noble ladies

577
00:29:38,225 --> 00:29:41,561
are the finest dancers in the capital,

578
00:29:41,585 --> 00:29:44,405
especially Lady Wen.

579
00:29:55,385 --> 00:29:57,481
You truly understand me.

580
00:29:57,505 --> 00:29:58,925
Thank you for the praise.

581
00:29:59,665 --> 00:30:00,921
Your Majesty,

582
00:30:00,945 --> 00:30:01,841
you must not leave.

583
00:30:01,865 --> 00:30:04,041
These ladies are all daughters
of important ministers.

584
00:30:04,065 --> 00:30:06,121
If you walk away like this,

585
00:30:06,145 --> 00:30:08,681
will you not chill the hearts
of your loyal officials?

586
00:30:08,705 --> 00:30:10,641
All my painstaking effort

587
00:30:10,665 --> 00:30:12,845
was for the sake of the realm.

588
00:30:13,345 --> 00:30:14,561
Please take pity

589
00:30:14,585 --> 00:30:16,281
on these old bones

590
00:30:16,305 --> 00:30:18,965
and at least watch a
little longer, Your Majesty.

591
00:30:31,625 --> 00:30:34,645
This subject, Wen Ruomei,
respectfully greets Your Majesty.

592
00:30:37,305 --> 00:30:40,481
-Greetings, Your Majesty.
-Greetings, Your Majesty.

593
00:30:40,505 --> 00:30:42,245
Your Majesty is in fine spirits.

594
00:30:49,305 --> 00:30:50,361
Your Majesty.

595
00:30:50,385 --> 00:30:51,525
Your Maj...

596
00:30:55,545 --> 00:30:57,125
Official Meng is in fine spirits too.

597
00:30:57,345 --> 00:30:59,161
You hid here to enjoy my performance.

598
00:30:59,185 --> 00:31:00,485
I have been wronged.

599
00:31:01,265 --> 00:31:02,921
Had I spoken rashly,

600
00:31:02,945 --> 00:31:04,601
would I not have ruined
Your Majesty's pleasure

601
00:31:04,625 --> 00:31:06,361
in watching all these beauties compete?

602
00:31:06,385 --> 00:31:07,965
I shall take my leave.

603
00:31:10,065 --> 00:31:11,361
Too late.

604
00:31:11,385 --> 00:31:13,805
No one watches a performance
without paying the performers.

605
00:31:16,225 --> 00:31:17,481
Why not take the stage as well

606
00:31:17,505 --> 00:31:19,121
and compete

607
00:31:19,145 --> 00:31:20,761
with these noble ladies?

608
00:31:20,785 --> 00:31:22,641
Your Majesty intends to use me again.

609
00:31:22,665 --> 00:31:24,201
If I perform here,

610
00:31:24,225 --> 00:31:25,961
tomorrow at court

611
00:31:25,985 --> 00:31:27,201
there will surely be several more memorials

612
00:31:27,225 --> 00:31:28,361
impeaching me for currying favor.

613
00:31:28,385 --> 00:31:29,685
Would that not be perfect?

614
00:31:30,305 --> 00:31:32,845
It would further prove
you are my favored official.

615
00:31:34,705 --> 00:31:37,005
Since Your Majesty wants me
to be this favored official,

616
00:31:37,625 --> 00:31:39,565
why not grant me a
substantive fifth-rank post,

617
00:31:39,945 --> 00:31:41,121
so my reputation as a flattering favorite

618
00:31:41,145 --> 00:31:42,561
will finally match reality?

619
00:31:42,585 --> 00:31:45,045
You certainly know how to bargain.

620
00:31:45,545 --> 00:31:47,041
One rank higher

621
00:31:47,065 --> 00:31:48,605
means standing above others.

622
00:31:50,545 --> 00:31:52,925
Since I will bear the infamy either way,

623
00:31:53,545 --> 00:31:55,361
I may as well gain
something tangible from it.

624
00:31:55,385 --> 00:31:57,001
Your Majesty, the dance is over.

625
00:31:57,025 --> 00:31:58,841
The noble ladies are still waiting.

626
00:31:58,865 --> 00:32:00,245
I am in excellent spirits today.

627
00:32:00,945 --> 00:32:02,121
How about this?

628
00:32:02,145 --> 00:32:03,605
Compete once more.

629
00:32:03,865 --> 00:32:05,241
Whoever wins

630
00:32:05,265 --> 00:32:07,325
will remain and dine with me.

631
00:32:12,585 --> 00:32:13,725
I will go first.

632
00:32:20,465 --> 00:32:22,081
I once learned

633
00:32:22,105 --> 00:32:23,885
a small street trick.

634
00:32:24,465 --> 00:32:27,165
It is called
"Spring Returns to Withered Wood."

635
00:32:27,545 --> 00:32:28,805
Your Majesty, please watch.

636
00:32:29,745 --> 00:32:31,561
This flower bud is waiting to bloom,

637
00:32:31,585 --> 00:32:33,045
like uncarved jade,

638
00:32:33,305 --> 00:32:35,241
holding limitless vitality within.

639
00:32:35,265 --> 00:32:37,285
It lacks only a breath of spring.

640
00:32:38,225 --> 00:32:40,245
Your Majesty is the true Son of Heaven,

641
00:32:40,705 --> 00:32:42,965
bearing the imperial
aura of the Purple Star.

642
00:32:43,225 --> 00:32:45,441
Please breathe

643
00:32:45,465 --> 00:32:47,245
a gentle breath of warmth upon this flower.

644
00:32:47,505 --> 00:32:48,521
Let it serve as the spark

645
00:32:48,545 --> 00:32:50,405
that awakens its boundless spirit.

646
00:33:10,625 --> 00:33:12,245
-It truly bloomed!
-It bloomed!

647
00:33:12,625 --> 00:33:13,805
Your Majesty, please look.

648
00:33:14,705 --> 00:33:16,081
Though plants are humble,

649
00:33:16,105 --> 00:33:17,725
even they know to
admire and follow strength.

650
00:33:18,305 --> 00:33:20,685
Bathed in heavenly grace,
they burst into life.

651
00:33:21,105 --> 00:33:22,325
This flower

652
00:33:22,665 --> 00:33:24,241
bloomed for Your Majesty.

653
00:33:24,265 --> 00:33:25,405
Excellent.

654
00:33:26,585 --> 00:33:29,765
"Spring Returns to Withered Wood,"
and the weak follow the strong.

655
00:33:30,385 --> 00:33:31,885
Such amusement

656
00:33:32,305 --> 00:33:33,601
far surpasses song and dance.

657
00:33:33,625 --> 00:33:34,921
Your Majesty,

658
00:33:34,945 --> 00:33:37,041
Meng Tinghui is clearly using
a cheap street illusion.

659
00:33:37,065 --> 00:33:38,281
It is unfit for refined company.

660
00:33:38,305 --> 00:33:40,285
Your Majesty holds the
people in your heart.

661
00:33:40,945 --> 00:33:42,561
The amusements of the streets

662
00:33:42,585 --> 00:33:44,285
also reflect the lives of the people.

663
00:33:44,625 --> 00:33:45,801
Whether all things under heaven

664
00:33:45,825 --> 00:33:47,881
can bask in imperial grace and flourish

665
00:33:47,905 --> 00:33:50,685
is what truly concerns Your Majesty.

666
00:33:52,825 --> 00:33:54,085
Meng Tinghui, receive the decree.

667
00:33:55,265 --> 00:33:56,921
From this day forward,

668
00:33:56,945 --> 00:33:58,081
you are promoted to the full fifth rank

669
00:33:58,105 --> 00:34:00,161
and shall continue overseeing all affairs
of the Bureau of Intelligence.

670
00:34:00,185 --> 00:34:02,445
I thank Your Majesty for this great favor.

671
00:34:06,105 --> 00:34:09,001
Official Meng, follow me
back to the Imperial Study

672
00:34:09,025 --> 00:34:10,321
and explain properly

673
00:34:10,345 --> 00:34:11,241
what other amusements and wisdom

674
00:34:11,265 --> 00:34:13,805
can be found among the common people.

675
00:34:15,065 --> 00:34:16,205
Yes.

676
00:34:17,545 --> 00:34:18,641
Your Majesty.

677
00:34:18,665 --> 00:34:19,805
Your Majesty!

678
00:34:20,385 --> 00:34:21,925
Your Majesty...

679
00:34:25,985 --> 00:34:27,401
His Majesty and Official Meng

680
00:34:27,425 --> 00:34:28,321
have important matters to discuss

681
00:34:28,345 --> 00:34:29,641
and cannot be disturbed.

682
00:34:29,665 --> 00:34:30,561
Please return home.

683
00:34:30,585 --> 00:34:31,841
-Sister Wen.
-Sister Wen.

684
00:34:31,865 --> 00:34:33,921
That seductress has bewitched His Majesty.

685
00:34:33,945 --> 00:34:36,041
I will have my father report her
to the Left Chancellor.

686
00:34:36,065 --> 00:34:37,685
How did you do it?

687
00:34:38,905 --> 00:34:40,805
That is my little secret.

688
00:34:41,345 --> 00:34:43,125
How could I casually tell someone else?

689
00:35:39,785 --> 00:35:40,925
-Good!
-Good!

690
00:35:47,345 --> 00:35:48,485
My lord.

691
00:35:49,425 --> 00:35:50,565
What is wrong?

692
00:35:50,905 --> 00:35:52,485
Why do you look so pale?

693
00:35:53,345 --> 00:35:54,485
My lord.

694
00:35:59,265 --> 00:36:01,125
My lord, what are you looking for?

695
00:36:02,585 --> 00:36:04,045
A ghost.

696
00:36:17,265 --> 00:36:19,005
Sister A-Xiang.

697
00:36:22,785 --> 00:36:24,161
Let go! Let go of me!

698
00:36:24,185 --> 00:36:26,641
Sister A-Xiang!

699
00:36:26,665 --> 00:36:30,245
Let go of me!

700
00:36:30,665 --> 00:36:32,405
Let go of me...

701
00:36:32,825 --> 00:36:34,245
Let go!

702
00:36:34,465 --> 00:36:36,925
Let go of me!

703
00:36:37,265 --> 00:36:39,845
Sister A-Xiang!

704
00:36:42,145 --> 00:36:43,841
Sister A-Xiang!

705
00:36:43,865 --> 00:36:48,561
Sister A-Xiang...

706
00:36:48,585 --> 00:36:49,841
Enough!

707
00:36:49,865 --> 00:36:51,565
Let go of me!

708
00:36:54,065 --> 00:36:55,885
Release her.

709
00:36:56,225 --> 00:36:58,281
Run! Do not come back!

710
00:36:58,305 --> 00:37:00,245
Sister A-Xiang!

711
00:37:17,025 --> 00:37:18,245
It is the middle of the night.

712
00:37:18,705 --> 00:37:19,881
Why are you knocking?

713
00:37:19,905 --> 00:37:21,041
My lord,

714
00:37:21,065 --> 00:37:23,085
you seemed distraught after returning,

715
00:37:23,585 --> 00:37:25,165
so I have been waiting outside your room.

716
00:37:25,545 --> 00:37:26,681
Just now,

717
00:37:26,705 --> 00:37:28,441
I heard shouting from inside,

718
00:37:28,465 --> 00:37:29,605
so I...

719
00:37:34,665 --> 00:37:36,405
Help me investigate someone.

720
00:37:57,145 --> 00:37:58,361
Your Majesty,

721
00:37:58,385 --> 00:37:59,521
I have watched Huiyin House
for several months

722
00:37:59,545 --> 00:38:00,881
and found nothing unusual.

723
00:38:00,905 --> 00:38:02,281
Only occasionally,
at the beginning of each month,

724
00:38:02,305 --> 00:38:03,401
the musicians take a convoy to the border

725
00:38:03,425 --> 00:38:05,045
to purchase daily supplies.

726
00:38:06,025 --> 00:38:07,281
Do you truly suspect

727
00:38:07,305 --> 00:38:08,681
that those highly trained assassins

728
00:38:08,705 --> 00:38:09,721
belong to Huiyin House?

729
00:38:09,745 --> 00:38:11,685
Whether my intuition is right

730
00:38:12,065 --> 00:38:13,485
will be revealed by a simple test.

731
00:38:25,305 --> 00:38:27,641
-Keep everything steady.
-Certainly.

732
00:38:27,665 --> 00:38:29,561
Most of these musicians come
from the common streets.

733
00:38:29,585 --> 00:38:30,521
It is hardly strange

734
00:38:30,545 --> 00:38:32,045
for them to know some martial arts.

735
00:38:33,825 --> 00:38:35,085
What is strange

736
00:38:35,465 --> 00:38:37,845
is that too many coincidences
have come together.

737
00:38:41,105 --> 00:38:42,245
My lord.

738
00:38:42,545 --> 00:38:44,205
We found it.

739
00:38:54,305 --> 00:38:55,441
My lord,

740
00:38:55,465 --> 00:38:57,005
do you know this person?

741
00:39:42,945 --> 00:39:44,361
Our previous assassination failed

742
00:39:44,385 --> 00:39:46,681
because we underestimated
that wretched emperor.

743
00:39:46,705 --> 00:39:48,841
Shen Zhishu and Huang Bo
protect him openly,

744
00:39:48,865 --> 00:39:50,645
and he has secretly
trained elite shadow guards.

745
00:39:50,945 --> 00:39:52,361
Master Shangguan has given the order.

746
00:39:52,385 --> 00:39:53,681
We have already alerted the enemy,

747
00:39:53,705 --> 00:39:55,201
so the assassination is suspended for now.

748
00:39:55,225 --> 00:39:56,725
But our great cause must not be abandoned.

749
00:39:57,065 --> 00:39:58,325
Understood.

750
00:39:58,545 --> 00:39:59,561
In this operation,

751
00:39:59,585 --> 00:40:01,285
we will proceed with the utmost caution.

752
00:40:09,025 --> 00:40:11,325
Young Master He, Young Master Shen.

753
00:40:13,745 --> 00:40:15,001
Miss Situ, only three days have passed,

754
00:40:15,025 --> 00:40:16,321
yet you look even more radiant.

755
00:40:16,345 --> 00:40:18,081
Today's makeup is like peach blossoms
reflected in spring water,

756
00:40:18,105 --> 00:40:19,881
brilliant without being gaudy,
pure and refined.

757
00:40:19,905 --> 00:40:21,161
Every time Young Master Shen sees me,

758
00:40:21,185 --> 00:40:22,561
his lavish compliments never stop

759
00:40:22,585 --> 00:40:23,841
and are never repeated.

760
00:40:23,865 --> 00:40:25,881
-How very thoughtful of you.
-I saw several musicians

761
00:40:25,905 --> 00:40:28,001
with carriages prepared
and in a great hurry.

762
00:40:28,025 --> 00:40:29,605
Is there some urgent matter?

763
00:40:30,065 --> 00:40:31,681
They are merely going
to the border to purchase

764
00:40:31,705 --> 00:40:33,961
incense, fabrics, and other
supplies for the house.

765
00:40:33,985 --> 00:40:35,481
It seems none of the capital's shops

766
00:40:35,505 --> 00:40:37,645
can satisfy the proprietress.

767
00:40:37,865 --> 00:40:39,081
You must mobilize such a large group

768
00:40:39,105 --> 00:40:40,321
just to shop at the border.

769
00:40:40,345 --> 00:40:41,841
To tell you the truth,

770
00:40:41,865 --> 00:40:43,961
Huiyin House consumes great quantities

771
00:40:43,985 --> 00:40:45,001
of incense and wood for instruments.

772
00:40:45,025 --> 00:40:46,481
The expense is considerable.

773
00:40:46,505 --> 00:40:48,441
Since Great Ning opened trade with Beijian,

774
00:40:48,465 --> 00:40:50,721
goods at the border have been excellent
and fairly priced.

775
00:40:50,745 --> 00:40:51,961
I often send the musicians

776
00:40:51,985 --> 00:40:54,361
to purchase unusual items there

777
00:40:54,385 --> 00:40:55,521
to attract customers.

778
00:40:55,545 --> 00:40:57,885
You truly know how to run a business.

779
00:40:58,505 --> 00:40:59,921
No wonder Huiyin House

780
00:40:59,945 --> 00:41:01,961
has become the capital's
foremost establishment,

781
00:41:01,985 --> 00:41:04,405
frequented by
powerful officials and nobles.

782
00:41:05,105 --> 00:41:06,881
Gentlemen, please do not remain standing.

783
00:41:06,905 --> 00:41:08,645
Tea has been prepared in a private room.

784
00:41:09,345 --> 00:41:10,441
I will take you there.

785
00:41:10,465 --> 00:41:12,241
There is no hurry.

786
00:41:12,265 --> 00:41:14,001
I have not yet had the chance

787
00:41:14,025 --> 00:41:15,645
to properly look around the first floor.

788
00:41:17,625 --> 00:41:19,081
You little wretch.

789
00:41:19,105 --> 00:41:20,925
Were you so eager to see me?

